<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosea</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hosea</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Hosea chekhai, now arui khin dow 753-722 BC takra kowi chekhai. Risi Hosea tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang towm mih dow Juda pren kowi Uzia, Jotham, Ahaz hai Hezekia büah chowm mang mih khin khe chekhai, now nami khin khe Israel pren kowi chowm mang mih dow Joas kowh chapa Jeroboam chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hosea dow Gomer pami masiuüa kowi chawngah khai. Gomer dow kaah sakowm dowi mih masiuüa chekhai; aia dow plan plan Hosea kowi powtta khai. Nachenganchepaw Hosea mih Thurai ana pek iawng aia kowi krawi chamah khai, now nar hai rukraira hownia aia kowi ranla now Hosea pawla khai. Nami sangchia hownia uang tüng mih dow Israeluüa mih Gomer iawng Thurai tut-e kaah sakowm dowi chepaw awdara uowima mih saksing sanara hai katpaw taklowi dowi mih sakraura uowi rakowi asung khakma hown Thurai krawi klanah reng pami chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hosea chowng khe Israeluüa mih Thurai kaah sakowm iawng uowi dowi chekhai; amatni dow arup aren kowi chup khai, now chowm krang uowi krang paw angakma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi Thurai mih ripah khai. Thurai kowh ripra dow khin krama amatni luk kowi mang uowi dowi mih, tawng iawng mih phuchua paw amatni nowng chang dowi mih hai amatni kowh tawng iawng mih arup paw nauowi dowi mih ün chekhai. Kawmat paw amatni dow naiawng uowi reng tak chekhai. Tawkche pur prakowi amatni che Thurai tut-e uang plan khai hanow Thurai dow amatni kowi naplan saksing sanaah iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Chawkkrawma: Chawkkrawma pami dow kowmatia siri uanh sum mih masiuüa kowi kowh tek pe mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Iang chang: Iang chang pami dow masi uowi khowk, hua uowi khowk chepaw maru masi hai maru hua hown cham tapawk tanau mih maru kowi kowh tek pe mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Ripra: Ripra pami dow changta angak kung kowi kowh angak sung ka mih chekhai. Ripra dow achaing achaing nowngia phaw chekhai. Aigupta pren kowi Israeluüa uowi mih khin khe Israeluüa luk kowi Aiguptauüa changah anowng apowng rakowi Thurai dow amatni luk kowi maiow maiow ripra uang chin pe khai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Efraim: Efraim pami mami bowih kowi dow Israel pren kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawngphak prakowi kowh uowi mih machakuüa pungmadawng kowi Efraimuüa dow lang kür mih machak chekhai. Nami kowi dow Jakawb papaw tekah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Jakawb dow chenchapuüa kowh pipu chekhai. Nami klen kowi Samari papaw tekah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Samari dow tawngphak pra kowh pren kowi kowh marow kri chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Hosea paw masi mih hai kimchak 1:1-3:5</para>
  <para style="io1">Israeluüa kowi nakingküala kown mih laiklow 4:1-13:16</para>
  <para style="io1">Angak hownia uang plan hanow Thurai prasi nakala kownkow Israeluüa kowi hawah mih 14:1-9</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HOS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 1:1" />Juda pren kowi Uzia, Jotham, Ahaz hai Hezekia büah chowm mang mih khin khe Israel pren kowi dow Joas chapa Jeroboam chowm mang khai. Nami khin khe Beri chapa Hosea tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow mih uang towm khai.<verse eid="HOS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hosea masi chawkkrawma hai achauüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 1:2" />Hosea tut-e CHAKRAMANG rik tek laiklow mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Kowkowiah now iang chang dawma mih masiuüa kowi en vüi kowlo diah; en masi dow kaah sakowmma nauowi kown nadowi, now en kowh chauüa paw amatni kowh u iawng naown kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami powm iawng ang maru-uüa mih powtta ang khai, now kaah sakowmma uowi ang dowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="HOS 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 1:3" />Naiawng rakowi Hosea dow kowkowiah now Diblaim chama Gomer kowi kowlo khai. Akung kowi amasi dow kum nau hanow pen chapa lowk ia khai. <verse eid="HOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 1:4" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Hosea mih, “Jezrel marow kowi kowh maru akawmma kowi Jehu saita khai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh chapa ming mih Jezrel rük pe diah. Jehu kowh krungchakuüa kowi dow alenma ang naripah kown, now Israel pren dow ang nachurta pe kown. <verse eid="HOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 1:5" />Nami ni khe dow Jezrel lawngrawi kowi Israeluüa kowh leba ang naklowkta pe kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="HOS 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 1:6" />Nami kung kowi Gomer dow kutplan kum nau hanow pen chama lowk ia khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Hosea mih, “Israeluüa kowi ang nasakrauah kown nadowi bowt. Naiawng rakowi aming dow Lo-Ruhama pahai rük pe diah. (Lo-Ruhama pami dow ‘Sakrau dowi’ pami chekhai). Amatni kowi dow mapaw ang nalawtah kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="HOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 1:7" />Nachenganchepaw Judauüa kowi dow ang nasakrauah kown, now amatni kowi dow ang nalawngah kown. Nami lawngra dow Leba, saidawng, tasen, kawrnga hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa hown nadowi. Ang CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai ngengche nalawngah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="HOS 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 1:8" />Lo-Ruhama iawn kham towng hanow Gomer dow plan pen chapa lowk ia khai iawk. <verse eid="HOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 1:9" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Hosea mih, “Enni dow ang kowh maru nadowi, now ang paw enni kowh Thurai nadowi. Naiawng rakowi aming dow Lo-Ammi pahai rük pe diah. (Lo-Ammi pami dow ‘Ang kowh maru nadowi’ pami chekhai). <verse eid="HOS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 1:10" />Nachenganchepaw pakat dow Israeluüa mih sata pang kowi kowh nowng khaiah dowi hai nowng rüaah dowi mih sema iawng naown kown. Nakhowk khe dow, ‘Enni dow ang kowh maru nadowi’ pami takcha ‘Masing Thurai kowh chauüa’ padow Thurai natek pe bowt kown.<verse eid="HOS 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 1:11" />“Judauüa hai Israeluüa dow amatni cham takhang rah hownia nauang lawt bowt kown, now amatni dow naplan tabawng iawk kown. Amatni pungmadawng hownia amatni dow narui aluchow lowk ia kown. Nami ni dow Jezrel kowi ni kraingma mih ni naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HOS 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 2:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “En kowh tainau-uüa kowi dow, ‘Ammi’ pahai en nahawah kown. (Ammi pami dow ‘Ang kowh maru-uüa’ pami chekhai). Now en kowh tuamowuüa kowi dow, ‘Ruhama’ pahai en nahawah kown. (Ruhama pami dow ‘Ang sakrauah miuüa’ pami chekhai),” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 2:2" />Maiawngün dow Israeluüa vüi CHAKRAMANG tekah mih laiklow chekhai:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HOS 2:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:2">“Enni kowh u kowi nangah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:2">Aia dow ang kowh masi nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:2">now ang paw aia kowh hua nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:2">Aia kowi dow hangah dit;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:2">aia kowh chawkkrawma lup pacham towta bowt lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:2">aia kowh iang chang lup mih pacham churta bowt lah.<verse eid="HOS 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 2:3" />Naiawng nadowi hanow tengiow tengklaima aia kowi ang natowah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:3">aia uang dia khe kowh iawng tengiow tengklaima ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:3">Aia kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma iawng ang nachangah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:3">now asi uowi dowi mih krawng iawng aia kowi ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:3">Aia kowi dow tui sakkrai hown ang nape kowngah kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 2:4" />Aia kowh chauüa dow iang chah chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:4">naiawng rakowi ang nasanaah kown nadowi.<verse eid="HOS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 2:5" />Amatni kowh u dow chang iang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:5">amatni kowi kowh kumah miia dow rukraira lup chang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:5">Aia tek mih, ‘Ang kowh manau-uüa kung ang tawi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:5">amatni dow nape ang tui hai chakkham kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:5">kanrawn sau hai la paw nape ang büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:5">Nami klen kowi ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la paw nape ang kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 2:6" />“Naiawng rakowi chuh mung hown ang napitta pe tiama kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:6">nakhila tiama dowi bowt kownkow aia tavir lut ang nathawp pe tap kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 2:7" />Aia dow amanau-uüa kung nakawikrawi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:7">Nachenganchepaw nakrawi ia um kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">Nakhowk khe aia tek kown mih, ‘Ang kowh huachük tut-e ang naplan kown taih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:7">nakowi dow kawmat kowh lak-e ang lang iung,’ napa kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 2:8" />Luprak, grep tui sar hai sau aia kowi peah mih dow ang taih diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:8">Nachenganchepaw aia dow tuk mat ang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:8">Kuh hai tai paw ahuma ang peah chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:8">Tawkchedow naiawngün mih Baal vüi kowi aia tawngah khai.<verse eid="HOS 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 2:9" />Naiawng rakowi cha min hai grep tui sar phaw khowk now ang napawta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:9">phumla siri kownkow ang peah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la dow ang plan pawta pe kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 2:10" />Aia kowh manau-uüa pur kowi aia kowh rukraira lup dow ang natüng pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:10">ang rut hownia aia kowi dow miapaw uang nowng lawngah kown nadowi.<verse eid="HOS 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 2:11" />Aia kowh piawra khin maten ang narimta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:11">Lasi Pawi, Tanai Ni hai pawi ni maten ang narimta pe kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 2:12" />“Aia tek mih, ‘Grep ruih hai uidut singh dow ang manau-uüa pe ang mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:12">naiawngün dow taphua taiua sung pe ang büah mih chekhai,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:12">Naiawngün maten dow ang napiakta pe bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:12">naiawngün dow ang pe chowngah kaurawng uanh hanow kaurawng uaramchak hawmh nachata bowk kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 2:13" />Aia tamata ang mih rakowi aia kowi dow ang naripah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:13">Baal thurai kowi cham chup cham iia mih rakowi ang naripah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:13">rutbüt hai kuaiseh hown tatawng hanow amanau-uüa kung kawikrawi mih rakowi ang naripah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:13">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="HOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh sakowmra</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 2:14" />“Nami kung kowi dow aia kowi naka iawk kownkow ang natek pe lai ding lai sau kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:14">aia kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang napawla hanow sakraura laiklow ang natek pe kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 2:15" />Nakowi dow aia kowh grep krum ang naplan peah iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:15">Pusara Lawngrawi dow sakowmra kimplawt ang nathawp pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:15">Nakowi dow aia malauüa khe kowh iawng natek meng bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:15">Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt khe kowh iawng natek meng bowt kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 2:16" />“Nami ni khe dow aia mih, ‘Ang hua’ padow nahaw ang bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:16">‘Ang kowh kim iah’ padow nahaw ang kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="HOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 2:17" />Aia nawr hownia dow Baal thurai ming ang namata pe bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:17">Aia dow Baal thurai kowi katpaw nahaw kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="HOS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 2:18" />Nami ni khe dow tawncher, asadua hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh hown ang nathawp en sangbowk laitawm kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:18">nahanow amatni dow nachang en naklak kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:18">Pren kowi mih leba hai saidawng hown tasenra ang nachurta pe bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:18">nahanow thaulangma hown enni nanowng müi bowt kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 2:19" />“Aw Israel, chowngchowng saksakma vüi masi pahai ang nakham en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:19">lainowm hai tara nowm hown ang namü en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:19">now achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai sanara ang natüng en kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HOS 2:20" />Kaah sakowmma hown nami dow ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:20">Nakhowk khe dow CHAKRAMANG kowi achi anawmma en natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HOS 2:21" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:21">nami ni khe dow ang naklang enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:21">Mukuang kowi ang napeah ana kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:21">mukuang dow krawng luk kowi napeah uang kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HOS 2:22" />Krawng dow luprak, grep tui sar hai sau nape enni bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:22">naiawng hown Jezrel kowi dow ang namingkhetah kown.<verse eid="HOS 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HOS 2:23" />Israel kowi dow aliu iawng pren kowi ang nasawtah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:23">‘Sakrau dowi’ pahai ang tekah mih kowi ang nasakrauah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">‘Ang kowh maru nadowi’ pahai ang tekah mih kowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:23">‘Ang kowh maru’ pahai ang nakhamah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">Nahanow amatni dow ‘En chowtaih anging kowh Thurai’ pahai natek ang büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HOS 3" />
  <para style="s">Amasi kowi Hosea klanah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 3:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Akeng mih kachakuüa hown en masi chang iang khowk chepaw kowsakrauah diah. Israeluüa mih akeng thurai kowi cham chupiia khai, now phuchua müa kawm paw cham cha büah reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowi sakrauah reng, nami iawng en paw en masi kowi kowsakrauah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 3:2" />Naiawng rakowi tai laitanga iun hai püm hamüt tawng hown nami masiuüa kowi ang uang ranla khai. <verse eid="HOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 3:3" />Nami kung kowi ang tek pe mih, “Ang kim kowi akrama en nauowi kown takla, now en kowh chawkkrawma lup mih en nataingta kown takla. Nami khin khe mia hown paw en nataphua taiua kown nadowi; ang hown khowm padow en nataphua taiua kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="HOS 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 3:4" />Nami powm iawng Israeluüa mih mang, aluchow, uanap pawi, phuchua müa hua, ephawd kowrmow hai arup aren uowi dowi kowi ni akawmma nauowi tak kown. <verse eid="HOS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 3:5" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai hai David chuprek chaprek hownia kowh amatni kowh mang prakowi naplan büah bowt kown. Achur prakowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kram kowh chür klukluk se nauang büah kown, now CHAKRAMANG mih amatni kowi nachangah iung bowt kown.<verse eid="HOS 3:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HOS 4" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh angak</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 4:1" />Aw Israeluüa, CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:1">pren kowi kowh uowi miuüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kingküara uowi achap:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:1">Pren kowi kaah sakowm mih hai tasakraura uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:1">now Thurai kowi paw achingma miapaw tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 4:2" />Amatni dow sawi kham, dai lai tek hai sai maru reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:2">now amatni dow kuk hai chang iang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:2">Amatni dow ari arow piak hai lowkkowlowk tasaila prung khai.<verse eid="HOS 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 4:3" />Naiawng rakowi pren dow uowila uiting uangtak khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:3">nakowi kowh uowi miuüa dow chum büah iawlaw khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:3">now asadua, uakling uaber hai sawng dam paw kowng iawlaw khai.<verse eid="HOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 4:4" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Nachenganchepaw miapaw hang tape aprek büah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:4">now miapaw hang tape angak büah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow uamowuüa kowi kowh chawktowk miuüa iawng enni phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="HOS 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa kowi naripah kown mih auan</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 4:5" />“Ni-e hai uar-e khe enni uamowuüa dow natatui kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:5">risi iuauüa paw enni hown natawi tatui kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:5">Naiawng rakowi enni kowh u Israel kowi ang napiakta kown.<verse eid="HOS 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 4:6" />Tukra uowi dowi rakowi ang maru-uüa piak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:6">enni dow tuk ang kown nau dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">Naiawng rakowi ang paw nuata enni khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:6">enni mih ang kowh uamow nadowi bowt tham,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">Thurai rirow enni tamata khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:6">Naiawng rakowi ang paw enni chauüa kowi ang natamata bowt kown.<verse eid="HOS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 4:7" />Amatni dow prung ngamlam chang ngak ngamlam chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:7">naiawng rakowi amatni kowh ringkawra dow prawng renra ang nape chowngah kown.<verse eid="HOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 4:8" />“Ang maru-uüa uang pawla ngak lawt lük müa uanap hanow uamowuüa mih mu tawi du khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:8">Naiawng rakowi ang maru-uüa chang ngak hanow uamowuüa mih awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 4:9" />Tawng iawng chow uamowuüa chang, naiawng maru-uüa paw tawi chang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:9">Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih amatni bowkbowk kowi ang naripah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow chang lup ngak bowk chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 4:10" />Amatni dow nacha kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:10">Tawkchedow naduh büah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:10">Nachang iang büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:10">Tawkchedow naprung büah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:10">Amatni dow nachup arup büah kownkow CHAKRAMANG kowi nuata büah mih chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 4:11" />Amatni dow iang chang hai grep tui kowi sakrau kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi nuata khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:11">Iang chang hai grep tui dow maru kowh tukra mih krawi piakta reng chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 4:12" />“Amatni dow singh hown kowh thawpah mih arup tut-e cham paw prengia khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:12">singh raitua dow amatni kowi peah ana khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:12">Amatni kowh iang chang sak dow amatni kowi piakah khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:12">amatni dow chang iang kown nau kowh amatni kowh Thurai kowi nuata khai.<verse eid="HOS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 4:13" />Hungh towng mawng towng amatni dow ngen pe asadua now cham phuchua büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:13">kanchang singh hai pawng singh tut kowi cham towk maih büah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">Naiawng rakowi enni kowh chamauüa dow chowng chawkkrawma khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:13">now enni kowh iaumowuüa dow chang iang khai.<verse eid="HOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 4:14" />“Enni kowh chamauüa dow chowng chawkkrawma khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:14">now enni kowh iaumowuüa dow chang iang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi ang peah ripra dowi tham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:14">Tawngplawng kowchow panow chawkkrawmauüa tut-e cham kowi mih dow kachakuüa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:14">now chawkkrawmauüa hown Thurai chup kim kowi cham towk maih reng mih dow amatni chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:14">Nami bualama mih chenchapuüa dow napiak kown.<verse eid="HOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 4:15" />Aw Israeluüa, enni dow chang iang khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:15">Nachenganchepaw Juda kowi dow en kowh iawng mih aprek hang pauowi lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:15">Gilgal kowi hangkow kowi büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:15">Beth-Aven kowi paw hangkow kowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:15">Now masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown paw hang kham sawi büa diah.<verse eid="HOS 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 4:16" />Israeluüa dow lai üa kürma mih chiama iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:16">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG nakhetah kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:16">Dowm kowi kowh ruapur chauüa thingah iawng tawng iawng chow aia nathingah kown?<verse eid="HOS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 4:17" />Efraim dow arup chup kowi cham tawi tabawng khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:17">aia kowi dow pe tawi chupah taih bowt.<verse eid="HOS 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 4:18" />Amatni kowh arak kham chur hanow amatni dow chang iang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:18">amatni kowh aluchowuüa dow rukraira uowima mih chowm krang uowi krang kowi kaneuma naukhi khai.<verse eid="HOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 4:19" />Naiawng rakowi akürma mih li iawng amatni luk kowi ripra nauang ting kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:19">amatni dow arup arenuüa tut-e chang phuchua mih rakowi narukrai kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HOS 5" />
  <para style="s">Israel aluchowuüa kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 5:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">“Aw uamowuüa, mami laiklow sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:1">Aw Israeluüa, pe ching büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">Aw mang chenchapuüa, pe param büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:1">Tara chetra kowi enni kowi kingküala mih laiklow uang lawt khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru-uüa kowi Mizpa hai Tabawr kowi kowh arup aren kowi enni pe chupiiaah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:1">naiawng hown maru-uüa kowi leng chak ia prakowi enni kruila khai.<verse eid="HOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 5:2" />Israel aluchowuüa dow lainowmma iang chang di khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:2">Naiawng rakowi amatni bowkbowk kowi ang naripah kown.<verse eid="HOS 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 5:3" />Efraim lawnguan kowi ang tuk bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:3">now Israel paw ang hownia cham ia tapet dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:3">Efraim dow chang iang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:3">now Israel dow tasür talawk khai.<verse eid="HOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 5:4" />Amatni kowh angak rakowi amatni dow Thurai tut-e ia plan dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:4">amatni tut-e dow iang chang sak chowtaih uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:4">now CHAKRAMANG kowi tuk büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 5:5" />“Israel kowh bawrira dow aia kowi kingküaah mih saksi thuak pe khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:5">Efraimuüa hai Israeluüa dow amatni kowh angak rakowi natatheu kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:5">now Judauüa paw amatni hown natawi tatheu kown.<verse eid="HOS 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 5:6" />Amatni dow ruapur hai chia hawmh pawla now CHAKRAMANG kowi nakrawi cham kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:6">nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowi nakrum büah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni hownia dow CHAKRAMANG cham süt khai bowt.<verse eid="HOS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 5:7" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e kaah sakowm dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:7">amatni dow pen iang chah büah khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:7">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow uang mih Lacher Pawi dowi rawn natapiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:7">amatni hai amatni kowh laih ün paw natapiak kown.<verse eid="HOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 5:8" />“Gibeah hai Rama kowi kowtum baw büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:8">now Beth-Aven kowi hek se enni natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:8">‘Aw Benjamin, tasenra kowi krui anging diah,’ pabüa diah.<verse eid="HOS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 5:9" />Napeah ripra kown mih ni khe Efraim dow maru akhaw aklaima nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:9">naphaw ngengche kown mih dow Israel chenchapuüa pur kowi ang phuangah khai.<verse eid="HOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 5:10" />“Juda pren kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow rihi kowi kowh hua süt miuüa iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:10">Amatni luk kowi dow ang kowh kunmaraura mih tuikling mangma iawng ang nauang pe lawtah kown.<verse eid="HOS 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 5:11" />Efraim dow aia low hown auan uowi dowi mih arup aren kung cham krawi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:11">Naiawng rakowi aia dow nowng chang powng changra kham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:11">now tara chetra kowi ün maru nünah khai.<verse eid="HOS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 5:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow Hebrai lai hown uowi mih chim dowi chekhai.</char>
    </note> Efraim tut-e dow lowngsirin nachowua iawng ang na khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:12">now Judauüa tut-e dow akih lawt khowk mih uanh iawng ang chowng khai.<verse eid="HOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 5:13" />Efraim dow aia kowh rawka khi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:13">now Juda dow aia kowh ma khi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">Nami khin khe Efraim dow Asuria prakowi plan khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:13">now aia dow naka khowng kownkow mangkri tut-e kowchin maru khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">Nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow Asuria mang nanowng iungah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:13">now aia kowh ma paw nanowng iungta pe kown nadowi.<verse eid="HOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 5:14" />Efraim hai Judauüa tut dow krangsi iawng ang naown kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:14">amatni kowi dow ang nadi nasekta naknak now ang napowtta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:14">Amatni kowi dow ang nacham pawla kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:14">amatni kowi nauang lawngah kown mih amiapaw nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="HOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 5:15" />Amatni kowh angak taphuang dowi mowr mukuang kowi ang nakowuowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:15">ang prakowi pe ching büah dowi mowr ang matia kowh uowi rah kowi ang nakowuowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:15">Amatni dow akrat pusama hown nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:15">nami khin khe dow süngürma hown ang tut-e nauang plan büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HOS 6" />
  <para style="s">Sakkhawtma mih Israeluüa kowi Hosea chiaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 6:1" />Israeluüa tatek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">“Chu, CHAKRAMANG tut-e a-i kowplan diah sik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">Aia dow pe a-i arau khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:1">nachenganchepaw aia mih naiung a-i ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">Aia dow bawpta a-i naknak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:1">nachenganchepaw aia mih nabawm a-i ma ngengche kown.<verse eid="HOS 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 6:2" />Pre sum ni kung kowi aia dow nakrüng a-i iawk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:2">aia pur kowi tawi ia uowila iawk kownkow aia mih naiung a-i iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:2">now achük alai khe kowh iawng aia natow a-i iawk kown.<verse eid="HOS 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 6:3" />Chu, CHAKRAMANG kowi i tuk diah sik;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:3">aia kowi tukla kownkow aia kung i krawi diah sik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:3">Sat uang lawt iawng aia dow nauang tatüng ngengche kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:3">krawng kowi asi uowila kownkow bowthowk uang uang iawng dow aia nauang kown,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="HOS 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 6:4" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Efraim, tawng chow ang nachangla en kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:4">Aw Juda, en kowi paw tawng chow ang nachangla en kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:4">En kowh tachi tanawmra dow rau-e kowh mai iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:4">Nami dow rau-e kowh lüa tama mih nang tui iawng chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 6:5" />Naiawng rakowi ang kowh risiuüa hown ang dungta enni naknak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:5">now ang nawr hownia kowh laiklow hown ang saita enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:5">Ang kowh tara chet dow rau towng kowh anowi uang ting reng iawng uang ting ngengche reng chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 6:6" />Kaah sakowmma mih sakraura chowtaih ang nau, tawncher phuchua nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:6">Tikah mih uanap lak-e achingma tuk ang mih ang lang nau chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 6:7" />“Enni dow Adam iawng ang kowh laikham enni üata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:7">now kaah sakowm dowi mih maru enni chowng khai.<verse eid="HOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 6:8" />Gilead dow maru ngakuüa kowh marow chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:8">nakowi kowh maru dow krawi kuan maru now bawmah reng.<verse eid="HOS 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 6:9" />Damrauüa hawt mit maru iawng uamowuüa thum paw hawt mit maru khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:9">amatni dow Sekem tiama kowi hawt sai maru hanow lainowmma chang lup ngak büah khai.<verse eid="HOS 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 6:10" />Israel kowi suiiai kaniaima mih chap ang khi lowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:10">Efraim dow nakowi akeng thuraiuüa hown chang iang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:10">now Israel dow arup arenuüa hown tasür talawk khai bowt.<verse eid="HOS 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 6:11" />“Aw Juda, ang naplan pe enni prasi iawk kown ang nau chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:11">nachenganchepaw narip en kown mih khin paw ang khowm bowkta khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 6:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HOS 7" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG pur kowi Israeluüa uowi krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 7:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">“Angak uowi krang hownia ang maru-uüa nauang plan kown mih ang nau;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:1">Israel kowh arau iungta pe kown mih ang nau chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">Tawkche nami khin khe Efraim kowh angak mih uang tatüng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:1">now Samari kowh angak paw uang taphuang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">Amatni dow krawi limma maru khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:1">kuk mih dow kim kowi krawi kup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:1">now damrauüa dow prang kowi krawi rup khai.<verse eid="HOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 7:2" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow amatni kowh lup ngak sak kowi ang towah reng pami tuk büah dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:2">Amatni kowh angak maten dow amatni kowi rumta lut khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:2">naiawngün angak dow ang pur kowi atungma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 7:3" />“Mang kowi dow angak hown amatni pe awmrawmah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:3">now mang chintak miuüa kowi dow dai lai hown amatni pe awmrawmah khai.<verse eid="HOS 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 7:4" />Amatni dow chang iang bowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:4">Amatni dow kawm thawp mih kowh taping maih iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:4">nami taping dow kawm ngat pat sawp sua kla dowk mih taping iawng adenma chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 7:5" />Mang chang pawi mih ni khe mang chintak miuüa dow kham grep tui now pua khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:5">now mang dow prawngren miuüa prakowi cham tawi tangi khai.<verse eid="HOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 7:6" />Amatni dow cham kingküa maru khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:6">nami khin khe amatni kowh sak dow taping maih iawng lün khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:6">Amatni kowh kunmaraura dow uar prowt tasu mih maiphum iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:6">now rau-e khe kowh awr lün plup mih maih iawng khai.<verse eid="HOS 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 7:7" />Amatni dow taping maih iawng den bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:7">now amatni kowh kruitown miuüa kowi kamah büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:7">Amatni kowh mang maten kowi dow saita bowk khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:7">tawkche miapaw haw ang büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaah tawngkeng dowi mih Israeluüa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 7:8" />“Efraim dow akeng chenchap hown cham tasür talawk khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:8">aia dow kam dawnglang kowh asun uang dowi mih kawm iawng phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="HOS 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 7:9" />Aia kowh kür dow prenlang thuraiuüa kowi chupiia mih hownia piak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:9">nachenganchepaw aia dow nami tuk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:9">Aia kowh sam pau dow tauet plawt taih bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:9">nachenganchepaw aia dow lawngtang khowk mih hai kür uowi dowk mih tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 7:10" />Israel kowh bawrira dow aia kowi kingküaah mih saksi thuak pe khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:10">naiawng phaw khowk chepaw aia dow Thurai tut-e uang plan dowi tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:10">now Thurai prakowi aia dow towsak paw towsak dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 7:11" />“Efraim dow ka ching dowi tak mih uatur iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:11">aia dow mapaw prengia uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:11">Aia dow naka khowng kownkow Aiguptauüa kowi haw kakat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:11">now Asuria tut-e kowkowi kakat chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 7:12" />Amatni kowkowi kown mih khin khe ang nathang pe powk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:12">amatni dow mukuang kowi kowh uakling hawmh iawng nataia kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:12">Nakhowk khe dow amatni kowi mih krawng kowi ang nauang klala kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:12">Israeluüa kowi dow amatni kowh angak rakowi ang naripah kown.<verse eid="HOS 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa piak kown CHAKRAMANG naula khai mih auan</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 7:13" />“Amatni luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:13">Amatni dow ang hownia powt büah hanow akeng tiama kowi cham mang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">Amatni kowi nalawngah kown ang nau chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:13">tawkche amatni dow kingküala ang mih daila tek büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow pacham chum lah.<verse eid="HOS 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 7:14" />Amatni dow phangbek kowi nguk hai kar büah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:14">tawkchedow sakdawng hownia ang tut-e awr kar büah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:14">Uih-ak hai grep tui sar nakala kownkow amatni dow takua talawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:14">now amatni dow kingküa ang büah khai.<verse eid="HOS 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 7:15" />Tasen krang ang sangah hanow akürma ang changah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:15">nachenganchepaw amatni dow nachang ang angak kownkow sangkrang khai.<verse eid="HOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 7:16" />Amatni dow ang prakowi uang plan dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">Amatni dow aphukma kowh kaah atawng dowi mih leba iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:16">amatni kowh aluchowuüa paw Thurai tut-e bawrima mih laiklow tek rakowi nakowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow Aigupta pren kowi nachowng rensi küakau kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HOS 8" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa luk kowi Thurai kunmarau mih auan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 8:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:1">“Efraim, tum baw diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:1">Maru-uüa mih ang peah mih rirow chün dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:1">amatni dow ang kowh ari arow kowi kingküa khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:1">Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa tut-e ransu uang tarü khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:1">ransu dow uamu iawng uang tarü khai bowt.<verse eid="HOS 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 8:2" />Israeluüa dow kar se kar se CHAKRAMANG tut-e uang taphuang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:2">amatni dow, ‘Aw ang kowh Thurai, anging tuk en khowk,’ pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 8:3" />Tawkchedow Israeluüa mih aiung sia dow nuata büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:3">Naiawng rakowi ransu-uüa mih amatni kung kowi nauang krawiah kown.<verse eid="HOS 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 8:4" />Amatni dow ang low iawng nadowi hai manguüa kowi ruiah büah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:4">amatni nau iawng hai aluchowuüa kowi kloah büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:4">Amatni dow kuh hai tai hown thawp arup khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:4">Naiawng rakowi amatni mih napiak kown.<verse eid="HOS 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 8:5" />“Aw Samari, en maru-uüa nuata arup chup kown mih mün ni tak chow lakke kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:5">En kowh chia chah rup dow ang nowng mü dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:5">Nami luk kowi dow ang kunmarau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:5">ang kowh kunmaraura mih maih iawng lün pluplup towbowt.<verse eid="HOS 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 8:6" />Samari kowi kowh nami chia chah rup dow ang nateuta prawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:6">nami chia chah rup dow adima ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:6">Nami chia chah rup dow Thurai nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:6">nami dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh maru lowk ia thawpah mih chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:6">now nami dow rut tua chapma mih maru thawpah mih chowtaih.<verse eid="HOS 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 8:7" />“Amatni dow sawt li khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:7">now achur kowi nangen liku büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:7">Chapüi kowi dow tawngpaw anuk uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:7">now nami hownia dow mi naphaw kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:7">Phaw ditdet chepaw nami dow prenlang maru-uüa nachata pe kown.<verse eid="HOS 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 8:8" />Israeluüa kowi dow piakta khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:8">amatni dow asung uowi dowi mih uanh iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:8">now amatni dow akeng chenchap pungmadawng kowi cham uowi khai.<verse eid="HOS 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 8:9" />Amatni dow lowk ia lowk iachow cham mang panglang mih kaurawng uaramchak iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:9">amatni dow Asuria pren mowr kowkowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:9">Efraim dow tangka hown cham chang manau khai.<verse eid="HOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 8:10" />Lowra chenchap maru-uüa hown tangka hai amatni chang auiua khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:10">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow amatni kowi katsang ang nakuaah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:10">now amatni kowi mih ang naripah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:10">Amatni dow mang nowng chang powng changra krüa kowi nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:10">now lainowmma nakawm nakrat büah kown.<verse eid="HOS 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 8:11" />“Efraim dow nahenla angak kownkow ahuma thawp phuchuara khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:11">Nachenganchepaw nami phuchuara dow angak changra uang chowng khai.<verse eid="HOS 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 8:12" />Ang kowh ari arow laiklow mih amatni vüi ahuma ang rui pe khowk chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:12">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow naiawngün mih akeng chenchapuüa kowh naown padow ka tuakah büah khai.<verse eid="HOS 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 8:13" />Amatni dow ang vüi uang chang tawncher phuchua hanow anga dow chaah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:13">tawkche ang CHAKRAMANG mih amatni luk kowi sak-ih dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">Kawmat dow amatni kowh angak mih ang nakut plan tuak pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:13">amatni kowh angak rakowi ang naripah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:13">now amatni dow Aigupta pren kowi naplan büah kown.<verse eid="HOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 8:14" />Israeluüa dow amatni kowh thawp miia Thurai kowi tamata khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:14">Amatni dow kim aiuk aiukma thawp büah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:14">Judauüa dow marow ahuma kowi thawp pe tap khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:14">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh naiawngün marow luk kowi mih ang nauang chin pe maih kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:14">nahanow amatni kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim maten dow nakam bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 9:1" />Aw Israeluüa, akeng chenchapuüa iawng piaw müa pawi hang tawi chang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:1">Enni dow enni kowh Thurai tut-e kaah sakowmma enni uowi dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:1">enni dow enni kaah mih luprak hown akeng thuraiuüa kowi cham phuchuala khai.<verse eid="HOS 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 9:2" />Naiawng rakowi cha thuara hai grep uih küara dow maru-uüa kowi napeah chakkham kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:2">amatni dow naka grep tui sar kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="HOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 9:3" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG pren kowi tawi ia uowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:3">Efraim dow Aigupta pren kowi nakowplan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:3">now Asuria pren kowi asür alawkma mih chakkham nakowcha kown.<verse eid="HOS 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 9:4" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG vüi grep tui hown khamah mih uanap nachang kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:4">now amatni kowh tawncher phuchuaün paw CHAKRAMANG mih nasak-ih pe kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Naiawngün phuchua dow asür alawkma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:4">naiawngün dow uowila uiting uangtak mih maru-uüa kowh chakkham iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Naiawng rakowi naiawngün chakkham cha miuüa dow asür alawkma naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Naiawngün chakkham dow amatni sakkraira rim müa krowngchow vüi naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:4">Naiawngün chakkham dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi naia pawla kown nadowi.<verse eid="HOS 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 9:5" />Amatni kowh kawngmu pawi ni kowi tawng chow nachang büah kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:5">CHAKRAMANG kowh pawi ni kowi tawng iawng chow nasunah büah kown?<verse eid="HOS 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 9:6" />Piakra hownia powt büah mih khin khe Aigupta mih amatni kowi nakuaah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:6">now Memfis marow kowi amatni kowh uak mih nadupah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:6">Amatni krümah mih tai dow mawh namungah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:6">amatni kowh uowi rah dow chuh mung namungah kown.<verse eid="HOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 9:7" />Ripra khin uang ting khai bowt mih Israeluüa pacham tuk lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:7">tara chetra ni uang ting khai bowt mih sak kowi pacham towah büah lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">Amatni kowh angak dow lainowmma hu khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:7">amatni dow Thurai kowi lainowmma suiah büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow risiuüa kowi, “Bualama” pahai tuak büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:7">now Thurai Lümla ka miuüa kowi paw, “Thuklama” padow tuak büah khai.<verse eid="HOS 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 9:8" />Risi dow Thurai vüi Efraim kowi kowh kangchawng mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:8">Nachenganchepaw aia cham mang cham katra maten kowi leng chak ia kangowh chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:8">aia kowi dow aia kowh Thurai kim kowi khowm maru suiah khai.<verse eid="HOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 9:9" />Amatni dow alai kowh Gibeah kowi uowi khe kowh iawng chang ngak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:9">Thurai mih amatni kowh angak natuak pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:9">now amatni kowh angak rakowi amatni kowi aia naripah kown.<verse eid="HOS 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 9:10" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">“Süngrüp süngkangma kowi ka grep uih mih iawng Israeluüa kowi ang kaah mih chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:10">now uidut singh kowi kowh uih müng iawng alai chowng khe kowh enni pipu-uüa kowi ang tuakah chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow Bal-Peur tut-e kowkowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:10">now uowiah parukrai mih arup aren kowi tawi chupiia büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">Amatni dow amatni naukhi-ah mih arup iawng suiiai kaniaima phaw khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:10">now suiiai kaniaima tawi uowi büah khai bowt.<verse eid="HOS 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 9:11" />Efraim kowh rowsira dow uakling iawng nacham iow kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:11">Nakhowk khe dow ngeuüa paw nauang dia kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:11">mu paw miapaw namu kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:11">now chah paw miapaw naka kown nadowi.<verse eid="HOS 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 9:12" />Mia iawng mih chünchü thum chah khai chepaw nami chah kowi ang napawta pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:12">amatni kowh dow lowk iachow paw chah nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:12">Ang powtta pe mih khin khe amatni dow lainowmma nakawm nakrat kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:12">Amatni kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!<verse eid="HOS 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 9:13" />Tura marow klangiungma mih iawng Efraim klangiung mih ang khi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:13">Nachenganchepaw kawmat Efraim dow aia chauüa kowi angen miuüa tut-e nacham pawla kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 9:14" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mami maru-uüa vüi tawng chow ang nalü kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:14">Tawng chow amatni kowi en napeah kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:14">Amatni kowh chah ruih hai iawn dow piakta pe diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:14">amatni dow hang pacham ka chah lah.<verse eid="HOS 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 9:15" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">“Gilgal kowi amatni kowh türchaura maten uown büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:15">now nakowi mih amatni kowi ang uown suiah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Amatni kowi dow ang pren hownia ang naprütta kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:15">tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow chang angak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Amatni kowi dow ang nasakrauah kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:15">tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh aluchowuüa maten dow kingküa ang khai.<verse eid="HOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 9:16" />Efraim dow aprün keu mih singh iawng raw khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:16">Naiawng rakowi aia dow uih paw uih dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:16">Aia maru-uüa dow ka chah chepaw ang nakowngta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:16">amatni lang sakrauah mih chah kowi ang nasaita pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 9:17" />Amatni dow ang kowh Thurai low chün dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:17">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow Thurai mih nanuata kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:17">now amatni dow akeng chenchapuüa tut-e nakrawi len panglang kown.<verse eid="HOS 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HOS 10" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh angak hai ripra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 10:1" />Israel dow grep ruih mung asama mih kowi kowh auih achakma mih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:1">Tawkche aia dow uang kureng ngamlam akeng thurai vüi lang thawp phuchuara ngamlam khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:1">now aia pren dow uang iuksown ngamlam chupiiaah mih hua ün tawngah ngamlam khai.<verse eid="HOS 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 10:2" />Aia kowh maru-uüa saktuak dow kaah sakowm dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:2">kawmat dow amatni mih amatni kowh aprek nakur büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:2">CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowh phuchuara maten napiakta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:2">now amatni chupiiaah mih hua maten paw napiakta pe nak kown.<verse eid="HOS 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 10:3" />Nakhowk khe amatni natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:3">“CHAKRAMANG kowi a-i kram dowi rakowi a-i kowh mang uowi dowi mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:3">mang uowi chepaw mang dow a-i vüi tawngpaw nanowng chang kown nadowi chekhai,” pabüah kown.<verse eid="HOS 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 10:4" />Maru-uüa dow takham sawi naklak chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:4">amatni dow dai lai hown kham sawi büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:4">Naiawng rakowi amatni tut-e dow tara nowm nadowi mih prung khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:4">nami dow laih kowi kowh akru uowi mih mawh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 10:5" />Samari kowi kowh maru-uüa dow Beth-Aven kowi kowh chia chah rup tawng chü naown kown mih kowi kram khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:5">nami arup kowh klangiungra dow amatni hownia alakma kowi nacham kuakta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:5">Naiawng rakowi maru-uüa hai uamowuüa dow uowila uiting uangtak hai kar büah khai.<verse eid="HOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 10:6" />Nami arup dow Asuria kowi napawla pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:6">nami dow mangkri kowh mangmu vüi kowi napeah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:6">Efraim dow naka rukrai kown, now Israel paw aia kamrütta khowk mih rakowi narukrai kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh maru-uüa dow nami arup kowi owmsak khai.<verse eid="HOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 10:7" />Asowmchow mih singh mia kowi dow tui nawmla reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:7">nami iawng Samari maru-uüa hai amatni kowh mang kowi dow nacham pawla kown.<verse eid="HOS 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 10:8" />Israeluüa changla angak reng mih arup chupra dow napiak bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:8">Beth-Aven kowi kowh arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara maten napiak bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:8">now amatni kowh phuchuara maten paw chuh mung hown natamung bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:8">Nakhowk khe amatni dow aiuk aiukma mih hungh kowi natek pe kown mih, “Uang iu thia anging bowt!” napa kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:8">Now asowm asowmchow mih hungh kowi natek pe kown mih, “Anging luk kowi uang iu takla bowt!” napa büah kown.<verse eid="HOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 10:9" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:9">“Aw Israel, Gibeah kowi uowi khe hownia kawmat pat en chang lup ngak reng tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:9">lup ngak chang mih en uang huah ngamlam khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:9">Naiawng rakowi Gibeah marow kowi ransu-uüa nauang sen en kown.<verse eid="HOS 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 10:10" />En kowi dow ang nau khe ang narip en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:10">En kowh angak dow uang hu ngamlam chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:10">naiawng rakowi nauang sen en kownkow chenchap ahuma kowi ang nauang chinah kown.<verse eid="HOS 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 10:11" />Efraim dow asangia lai tuktama mih chiama iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:11">aia dow cha thua dawma mih chiama iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">Aia kowh ngawng klangiungma mih kowi dow ang natang pe laithawn tim kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:11">Juda kowi dow kür hown ang nape küngah laithawn tim kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:11">now Jakawb kowi dow akhawtma mih bawn ang nape pawkah kown.<verse eid="HOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 10:12" />“Ang tek mih, ‘Tachi tanawmra liu iung dow sawt büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:12">now sakraura luprak dow enni naka ngen kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">Bawn iawng akhawtma mih enni kowh sak thawnah büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:12">tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowi nacham kown mih khin kawmat chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">Enni che aia kowi cham hanow aia mih nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:12">now tachi tanawmra mih aia nauang pe enni kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 10:13" />“Nachenganchepaw angak liu mih enni sawt khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:13">angak sung dow enni ngenah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:13">now kuan rak dow enni chaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:13">Enni matia kowh kür kowi enni owmsak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:13">now enni kowh tasen müa siphai akawmma mih luk kowi enni neplawng nesak khai.<verse eid="HOS 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 10:14" />Kawmat dow enni pungmadawng kowi kramra uowima mih tasen naphaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:14">Enni kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim maten natapiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:14">naiawngün dow Beth-Arbel marow kowi Salman senah khe kowh iawng natapiak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:14">Nami ni khe dow u-uüa hai chauüa kowi mih kowng pat krawng kowi maru theuah khai.<verse eid="HOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 10:15" />Aw Bethel, en kowh angak dow nowm nowm hu khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:15">naiawng rakowi en paw Beth-Arbel iawng naphaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:15">Uar thowi hanow Israel mang kowi asaima napiakta kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 10:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Ngah chepaw Israeluüa kowi Thurai sakrauah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 11:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:1">“Israel kowi ngeuüa reng tak khe ang sakrauah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:1">ang chapa kowi Aigupta pren hownia ang uang hawla khai.<verse eid="HOS 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 11:2" />Nachenganchepaw Israel dow ang hawah ngamlam powt ngamlam chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:2">aia kowh maru-uüa dow tawncher hown Baal thurai kowi phuchuaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:2">now arup kowi ün nam iungma mih maikhük cham towk pe khai.<verse eid="HOS 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 11:3" />Efraim kowi sangah mang mih dow ang matia chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:3">now aia kowi kowh dawnah paiah mih paw ang matia chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:3">Nachenganchepaw aia kowh maru-uüa dow tuk ang büah dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:3">amatni kowi iungah mih dow ang matia ngengche pami tuk büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 11:4" />Ang dow sana sakraura hown amatni kowi ang kruiah reng chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:4">amatni kowh pangkawt hownia namuai dow ang uowt pe reng chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:4">now mum se amatni kowi dow ang peah chakkham reng chowdiah.<verse eid="HOS 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tarip kown nau dowi rakowi Israeluüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 11:5" />“Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa dow tarip now ang tut-e uang plan kown nau dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:5">naiawng rakowi amatni dow Aigupta kowi uowi khe kowh iawng nauowi iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:5">now amatni kowi dow kür hown Asuriauüa vüi nape changah lup kown.<verse eid="HOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 11:6" />Amatni kowh marow towng kowi dow tasen kraingma nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:6">amatni kowh tap dow natapiak bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:6">now amatni kowh sangkrangra angakma mih rakowi amatni dow napiak kown.<verse eid="HOS 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 11:7" />Ang maru-uüa dow ang hownia napowt kown mih kamrüt khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:7">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai pahai haw ang chepaw amatni dow ringkaw ang nowm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai sakraura luk kowi Israeluüa kowh sakowmra</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 11:8" />“Efraim, tawng iawng chow ang nape powt en kown chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:8">Israel, tawng iawng chow akeng mih maru rut kowi ang naap en kown chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:8">tawng iawng chow Adma hai Zebuim iüah kowi iawng ang napiak en kown chow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">En rakowi ang kowh sak mih lainowmma rau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:8">now ang kowh saksing sanara uang hu khai.<verse eid="HOS 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 11:9" />Ang kowh kramra uowima mih kunmarau ang nape lawtah kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:9">tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow lusa maru nadowi, ang dow Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">Naiawng rakowi Efraim kowi dow ang napiakah kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:9">Efraim tut-e kowh chimsaima uowi mih ang na chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:9">now ang kowh kunmaraura mih ang nauang pawla pe kown nadowi.<verse eid="HOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 11:10" />En maru-uüa mih ang kung kowi nauang krawi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:10">tawngplawng kowchow panow krangsi hek klow iawng atünma ang nahawah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:10">Ang hawah mih khin khe ang maru-uüa dow nauang plan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:10">amatni dow satkup hownia chür se nauang plan kown.<verse eid="HOS 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 11:11" />Amatni dow Aigupta pren hownia uakling iawng nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:11">amatni dow Asuria pren hownia uatur iawng chür se nauang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:11">Amatni kowi dow amatni kowh kim kowi ang nape uowiah iawk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:11">ang CHAKRAMANG, mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel hai Juda kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 11:12" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:12">“Efraim kowh dai lai hai Israel kowh limmara dow virta ang lut khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:12">Juda dow kaah sakowm mih Thurai chimsaima mih kowh lai chün pe dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 11:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HOS 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 12:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:1">“Efraim dow krawi li mih iawng mapaw asun uang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:1">aia dow ni chut chi satlawt li kung kowi cham tawi krawi reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:1">Aia dow dai lai hai nowng chang powng changra mih pe huah ngamlam khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:1">aia dow Asuria pren hown thawp taking tasangra khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:1">now aia dow Aigupta pren kowi cham sa kanrawn sau khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 12:2" />Juda luk kowi CHAKRAMANG tek kown mih uowi lowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:2">Jakawb kowi aia kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng aia naripah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:2">now aia kowh lup iawng aia kowi CHAKRAMANG napeah asung kown.<verse eid="HOS 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 12:3" />A-u mu lak kowi uowi reng tak khe aia dow ataimow kowh khawkchü kowi townah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:3">kimrengchow khe aia dow Thurai hown dowk takhüm khai.<verse eid="HOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 12:4" />Aia dow kramamu hown dowk takhüm khe nowngta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:4">aia dow kala sanara kownkow kar se lü prasira khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:4">Bethel kowi aia dow CHAKRAMANG hown takrum khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:4">nakowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih klang anging khai.<verse eid="HOS 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 12:5" />Aia dow lowra nowng chang mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:5">CHAKRAMANG pahai aia kowi maru-uüa tukah reng chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 12:6" />Aw Jakawb chenchapuüa, kawmat mih enni kowh Thurai tut-e uang plan diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:6">kaah sakowmma mih rah hai tara nowm mih townah büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:6">now enni kowh Thurai luk kowi atungma neplawng nesak büa diah.<verse eid="HOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 12:7" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Kun chang mih Efraim dow kuanla mih set tawngah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:7">aia dow kür hown krawi paw kown mih lainowmma daw khai.<verse eid="HOS 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 12:8" />Aia tek mih, ‘Nowm nowm ang kureng khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:8">dawngthawnguan ahuma ang krümta khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:8">Ang kowh lup maten kowi dow maru nakhi ang angak kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:8">ang kowh lup kowi dow maru nakhi ang atawi kown nadowi,’ pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 12:9" />Nachenganchepaw aw Efraim, ang chowtaih en kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:9">Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla en mih dow ang chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:9">Nami khin khe süngrüp süngkangma kowi tangbung kowi en uowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:9">nami iawng dow tangbung kowi ang nape uowi en iawk kown.<verse eid="HOS 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 12:10" />Risiuüa tut-e ang tek lai khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:10">amatni kowi mukmang ahuma ang pe khi-ah khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:10">now amatni kowi dow laiuat hown ahuma ang tek pe lai khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 12:11" />Gilead süng dow angak hown atekma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:11">naiawng rakowi aia maru-uüa dow napiak bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:11">Amatni dow Gilgal marow kowi chiala hown ahuma kowchang phuchua khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:11">naiawng rakowi amatni kowh phuchuara ün dow thawnah mih laih kowi kowh iawng nachowng hua krowng kown.<verse eid="HOS 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 12:12" />Jakawb dow Siria kowi cham powt khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:12">Israel dow nakala masi kownkow cham kowi nar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:12">now aia dow ruapur thing mih lup cham chang khai.<verse eid="HOS 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 12:13" />CHAKRAMANG dow Aigupta pren hownia Israel kowi nauang lawtla kownkow risi lowk ia kowi tawngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:13">now amatni kowi dow nami risi kowi CHAKRAMANG pe mingkhetah khai.<verse eid="HOS 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 12:14" />Nachenganchepaw Efraim dow CHAKRAMANG kowi lainowmma towkah kunmarau khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:14">CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh lup ngak rakowi aia kowi napeah aprek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:14">now aia kowh rukraira uowima mih angak rakowi aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG naripah kown.<verse eid="HOS 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HOS 13" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kunmaraura</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 13:1" />Efraim krungchak tek lai khe maru kawmuüa kram kowh chür reng chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:1">tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow Israel kowi apankrima mih krungchak chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:1">Nachenganchepaw Baal thurai kowi chupiiara kowi amatni kowi dow napiakta kownkow tukta pe mur khai bowt.<verse eid="HOS 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 13:2" />Kawmat mih aia kowh maru-uüa dow lang chang ngak ngamlam chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:2">amatni dow kowmatia vüi kowi tai hown arup sawnah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:2">now rut hown paw thawp arup aren büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">Naiawngün maten dow rut tua chapma mih kowh lup chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">Naiawngün arup lawnguan kowi amatni tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:2">“Uang chang phuchua miuüa dow chia chah rup kowi pacham namla lah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="HOS 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 13:3" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow rau-e kowh mai hai rau-e kowh lüa tama mih nang tui iawng naphaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:3">now bawk hownia kowh li rownla mih chapli hai tawngpawk hownia kowh lawt mih maikhük iawng naphaw büah kown.<verse eid="HOS 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 13:4" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:4">“Aigupta hownia ang uang lawtla en mih khin hownia ang chowtaih en kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:4">ang klen kowi en kowh Thurai lang uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:4">now ang klen kowi dow en kowh lawng miia lang uowi dowi bowt.<verse eid="HOS 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 13:5" />Süngrüp süngkangma kowi mingkhet en mih dow ang chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:5">now akang khawngma mih pren kowi mingkhet en mih dow ang chowtaih.<verse eid="HOS 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 13:6" />En maru-uüa kowi dow ang peah chakkham hanow du büah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:6">amatni du chakkham khe dow chang bawri büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:6">now akung kowi dow tamata ang büah khai.<verse eid="HOS 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 13:7" />Naiawng rakowi krangsi iawng dow amatni luk kowi ang nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:7">pri rengchow iawng dow tiama ria kowi ang hawt pawmah kown.<verse eid="HOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 13:8" />Achah tama mih tawm iawng dow amatni kowi ang nakhümah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:8">now amatni kowh buk dow ang nasekta pe naknak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:8">Krangsima iawng dow amatni kowi ang namakah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:8">kaurawng uaramchak iawng dow amatni kowi adi asekma ang nachangah kown.<verse eid="HOS 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 13:9" />“Aw Israel, en dow kingküa ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:9">khowng en mih kowi en dow kingküaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:9">Naiawng rakowi ang napiakta en kown.<verse eid="HOS 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 13:10" />Marow maten kowi nanowng lawng en kown mih en kowh mang tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:10">‘Pe ang pren mingkhet miuüa dit, pe ang mang dit,’ padow en lü khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:10">En lüah mih pren mingkhet miuüa dow tawng kowi chow?<verse eid="HOS 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 13:11" />Naiawng rakowi ang kunmarau lai kowh ang pe en mang chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:11">nami mangra dow ang kunmarau en lai kowh ang plan pawta en khai.<verse eid="HOS 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 13:12" />“Efraim kowh aprek maten dow ruiah now towah kaneu khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:12">aia kowh angak maten dow krüm pe khai.<verse eid="HOS 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 13:13" />Penchow kimuowi mu rau iawng aia kowi dow arau dowkah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:13">nachenganchepaw aia dow sangching uowi dowi tak mih ngeuüa iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:13">Aia kowh dow dia khin uang na khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:13">nachenganchepaw aia dow uang lawt kown nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 13:14" />“Mami maru-uüa kowi dow lusa kowi kowh kowngra hownia ang nalawngah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:14">amatni kowi dow makowng kür hownia ang nalawngah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">Aw kowngra, en kowh akru uang pawla diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:14">aw makowng, en kowh hawi uang pawla diah!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi dow ang nasanaah kown nadowi.<verse eid="HOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 13:15" />“Efraim dow atainau-uüa pungmadawng kowi lang iuksown chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:15">nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh satlawt li mih süngrüp süngkangma hownia nauang hutah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">Aia kowh awchawng kowi dow tui nauowi kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:15">now aia kowh tuikuam dow nakang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">Aia kowh dawngthawnguan krümra kowi kowh uanh maten dow maru narupta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:15">now aia kowh asung khakma mih uanh maten paw maru napawta pe kown.<verse eid="HOS 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 13:16" />“Samari maru-uüa dow amatni kowh Thurai kowi kingküaah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:16">amatni kowh angak rakowi amatni dow naka ripra kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:16">Amatni dow tasenra kowi nakowng büah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:16">amatni kowh chauüa kowi dow krawng kowi natheuta pe naknak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:16">now amatni kowh apawmma mih masiuüa kowi paw nakhuekta pe mu nak kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 13:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="HOS 14" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa tarip hanow naka prasi kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 14:1" />Aw Israeluüa, enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tut-e uang plan büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:1">enni matia kowh ngak rakowi enni dow piak khai.<verse eid="HOS 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 14:2" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tut-e uang plan hanow maiawng uang tek pe büa diah:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:2">“Anging kowh angak maten lawtta anging diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:2">anging kowh aiung sia maten hawt dowk anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:2">Nahanow chiala hown phuchua en khe kowh iawng nawr hown anging nowng rowsi en kown towbowt.<verse eid="HOS 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 14:3" />Asuriauüa dow nowng lawng anging kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:3">tasen müa kawrnga luk kowi anging naneplawng nesak kown nadowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:3">Anging matia rut hown kowh thawpah mih arup kowi, ‘Anging kowh thurai,’ pami anging natek kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en tut-e chowtaih saratchow chauüa ka saksing sanara reng,” pabüa diah.<verse eid="HOS 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 14:4" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:4">“Tamara tia kowi amatni cham mang mih hownia dow ang nauang plan pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:4">now amatni kowi dow aiawngma hown ang nasakrauah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni luk kowi kowh ang kunmaraura dow prowng khai bowt.<verse eid="HOS 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 14:5" />Ang dow nang tui iawng Israel tut-e nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:5">aia dow lili pau iawng nathar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:5">now Lebanawn kowi kowh sidar singh iawng aprün nasawt kown.<verse eid="HOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 14:6" />Aia kowh amia dow ahuma naprek kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:6">aia dow kanrawn singh iawng naklangiung kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:6">now Lebanawn kowi kowh sidar singh iawng nanam iung kown.<verse eid="HOS 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 14:7" />Ang tut-e uang plan miuüa dow ahuma napau kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:7">ang klim kowi kowh tanai miuüa dow ahuma nauih kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:7">Amatni dow grep ruih iawng uih hown pau hown natek mup kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:7">Lebanawn kowi kowh grep tui iawng dow anam iung natauet kown.<verse eid="HOS 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 14:8" />Aw Efraim, arup arenuüa hownia alakma lang uowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:8">en awr lü awr leng khe klang en mih hai mingkhet en mih dow ang chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">Ang dow asama mih sidar singh iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:8">en kowh uih maten dow ang hownia kowh uang ting mih chowtaih,” pakhai.<verse eid="HOS 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 14:9" />Chanlaima mih maru dow nami lawnguan kowi pacham tuk lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:9">Prengia uowi mih maru dow nami lawnguan kowi pacham tasang lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:9">CHAKRAMANG kowh tiama dow anowmma mih tiama chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:9">achinawmma mih maru-uüa dow nami tiama kowi mang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:9">tawkche maru ngakuüa dow nami tiama kowi tatheu reng chekhai.<verse eid="HOS 14:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 14" />
</usx>